Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value LINK_STATUS (\S+)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value ZONE (\S+)
Value SUB_NETMASK (\S+)

Start
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${SUB_NETMASK}\s+${LINK_STATUS}\s+${ZONE} -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${SUB_NETMASK}\s+${LINK_STATUS} -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+(dhcp|dhcp-up|\*{0,3}\.\S+)\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${SUB_NETMASK}\s+${LINK_STATUS}\s+${ZONE} -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+(dhcp|dhcp-up|\*{0,3}\.\S+)\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${SUB_NETMASK}\s+${LINK_STATUS} -> Record
